      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i'm curious about your reasoning for the lower score on B.\n\nif someone in a high-level role used that style of speaking or writing, what would that imply about them to a board of directors? like, is the issue just the \"casualness,\" or is there a perception that using that specific dialect correlates with a different level of education or even competence?",
